&lt;div&gt;We, the R&amp;amp;D Department Humanoids at Agile Robots SE, are seeking driven Engineering Students as working Students or Interns (at least for six months) with proven hands-on experience, preferably in the field of robotics. You will support the mechanical engineers in the humanoid R&amp;amp;D department in developing real-world, high-DOF humanoid robotic systems. We are searching for on-site support in our lab in Munich for multiple fields and focus areas like gripper/hand development, system identification, control application, and hardware design. &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are thrilled to know which of these topics you find most interesting to work on. Please make sure to specify and explain your favorite topic in your application&lt;/div&gt;
